        "title": "RIVUS TRV-FACTSHEET-ENG-VERSION",
        "content": "---\nsource: \"/Users/kenhuynh/Desktop/2. Thong tin du an/06_Rivus/THE_RIVUS_4/Leaflet_Brochure/ENG/RIVUS_TRV-FACTSHEET-ENG-VERSION.pdf\"\nfile: \"RIVUS_TRV-FACTSHEET-ENG-VERSION.pdf\"\nsize_kb: 2214\nmodified: 2022-03-22\nconverted: 2026-08-30\n---\n\n# RIVUS_TRV-FACTSHEET-ENG-VERSION\n\n> Nguồn là PDF scan — nội dung dưới đây do OCR sinh ra, cần soát lại.\n\n## Trang 1\n\nTHE “2IVUS\n\nELIE SAAB\n\nFACTSHEET\n\nBy Masterise Homes\nFebruary, 2022\n\ni\n\nMASTERISE HOMES\n\n## Trang 2\n\n[HE 734IVUS nd\n\nELIE SAAB MASTERISE HOMES\n\nMASTERISE HOMES\nMasterise Homes — a member of Masterise Group, is a pioneer in bringing world-class excellence to the\ndevelopment, operations, and management of luxury real estate products and services, in the Vietnamese market\nand beyond.\nWith a one-of-a-kind portfolio comprising the largest Branded Residences in South East Asia, Masterise Homes\ndemonstrates world-class capabilities via a strategic partnership with Marriott International, the largest hotel brand\nin the world with iconic brands of Marriott, JW Marriott and The Ritz-Carlton.\nAt Masterise Homes, we are committed to developing exquisite real estate projects to impeccable standards for\nthe ultimate customer experience, delivering tangible and enduring value.\nPRESTIGIOUS PROJECTS BY MASTERISE HOMES\ne MASTERI THAO DIEN\nThe first luxury project preferred by District 2’s international community and was the catalyst for the growth\nof real estate development in the area.\ne MILLENNIUM\nA premium project in the Central Business District of HCMC.\n® M-ONE SAIGON SOUTH\nA contemporary design for the modern young family, located at the centre of District 7.\ne M-ONE GIA DINH\nA modern project with comfortable living spaces in the heart of Go Vap District.\ne MASTERI AN PHU\nA luxury residence located in District 2 offering resort-style living for the discerning local and international\ncommunity,\ne MASTERI CENTRE POINT\nA premium compound residence offering an elevated lifestyle, located in the largest township in HCMC,\nGrand Park.\n¢ MASTERI WATERFRONT\nA premium development strategically located at the heart of Ocean Park in the east of Hanoi providing an\n\nexclusive yet attainable living experience that sets residents apart from the rest.\n\ne MASTERI WEST HEIGHTS\nA premium development strategically located at the heart of Smart City, offers residents the opportunity to\nlive an unparalleled lifestyle. Masteri West Heights’s connectivity and modern aesthetics combined with an\nabundance of exclusive amenities make this a home unlike any other.\n\ne LUMIERE RIVERSIDE\nThe last gem of Thao Dien neighborhood, masterfully blending an eco-friendly lifestyle with the pinnacle of\nluxury living.\n\ne GRAND MARINA, SAIGON\nThe first Marriott-branded residence in Vietnam opens an exciting new chapter in the country's history. It\noffers an exceptionally rare opportunity to call an iconic waterfront District 1 address home.\n\ne THE GRAND, HANOI\nA branded residence that is in a class of its own with a prestigious address in Hang Bai Street in the heart of\nHa Noi's Central Business District.\n\n## Trang 3\n\n[HE RIVUS\n\nELIE SAAB\n\nTHE RIVUS\n\ni\n\nMASTERISE HOMES\n\nASIA'S FIRST RIVERFRONT VILLA inspired by HAUTE COUTURE\n\nFor the very first time in Asia, ELIE SAAB, together with Masterise Homes, collaborated to launch a collection\nof exquisite villas by the river, creating a world defined by timeless elegance and beauty. ELIE SAAB brings his\nillustrious sense of glamour, sophistication, and unrivalled craftsmanship to these luxury villas by the river.\n\nTHE RIVUS is “a refined and harmonized artwork”, with a limited 121 one-of-a-kind villas that echo the spirit\n\nand glamour of high fashion.\n\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\n\nProject name\nTagline\nDeveloper\n\nTotal site area\nTotal Villa unit\n\nConstruction Density\nTotal Area of Internal Traffic & Landscape\nVillas Ownership\n\nTenure\nExpected Handover\n\nType of Villa\n\nTHE RIVUS\nBRINGING HAUTE COUTURE TO VILLA LIVING\nMasterise Homes — A Member of Masterise Group\n\n26.73 Ha\n\n121 Villas\n\nApproximately 4"
